OL,3,GNEWSAHow Yorkshire shaped the Brownlee
OL,4,Aera
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've had an incredible career. It's
OL,7,Fbeen nearly 30 years long and I've won
OL,8,Fmore than I ever thought I'd ever
OL,9,Fachieve. It's time to move on because I
OL,10,Fwouldn't be doing myself justice by
OL,11,Fdoing it half-heartedly."
OL,13,FThose were the words of triathlete
OL,14,FJonny Brownlee, who announced his
OL,15,Fretirement from professional sport on
OL,16,FFriday, aged 36.
OL,18,FNow the Olympian is taking a step back
OL,19,Ffrom the starting line, former coaches,
OL,20,Fteachers and those inspired by his
OL,21,Fsuccess have spoken about his legacy.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
